GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_IntermediaryNetworkEffectsFederation> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_IntermediaryNetworkEffectsFederation> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_IntermediaryNetworkEffectsFederation> ;
    narr:childCount "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """This position argues that durable moats in a commodifying-AI market come from [sitting in between — the telephone-company thesis](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_109), grounded in the claim that [the marginal cost of software development is approaching zero](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_105). The supporting arc runs through [rapid commodification of any shown capability](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_119), the warning that [building a better version hands incumbents the blueprint](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_115), and the historical analogy that [a platform can destroy an incumbent without beating it on its own terms](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_111) because [switching costs, not quality, protect the installed base](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_113). The thesis is applied to transcription tools — [commodity players predicted to fade because they don't sit in between](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_117) — and made concrete via [cross-company paid access making each party's copy more valuable](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_125) and [the viral flip: wanting it because you have it](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_127), restated in a later call as [the network-effect user perspective voiced directly](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_16). The mechanism is sketched as [paid graphs gaining permitted interconnect from each other's graphs](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_128), opening the open problem of [secure, managed federation across organizational graphs](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_158) — hard, per the claim that [LLMs derive value from private context and are weak at this space](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_157). A second, adjacent thesis appears in [charging only for the in-the-middle layer while everything else is free](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_133).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_105> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_109> ;
